(Microsoft.CodeAnalysis) | Microsoft Learn</a></li>
<li>Roslyn's implementation: <a href="https://github.com/dotnet/roslyn/blob/6c4a46a31302167b425d5e0a31ea83c9a9aa1d09/src/Compilers/Core/Portable/Optional.cs" rel="nofollow noreferrer">roslyn/src/Compilers/Core/Portable/Optional.cs - dotnet/roslyn | GitHub</a></li>
</ul>
